auth {
  mode: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # @minerva/api

  Every request in this collection targets `apps/backend/api` — the NestJS service that the
  frontends call. Routes come from `apps/backend/api/src/app.controller.ts`; the `EmailJob`
  payload comes from `@minerva/typescript-lib` (`shared/typescript-lib/src/queue.ts`).

  Select the **local** environment before sending anything — `{{baseUrl}}` is defined
  there, not here.

  The service has no authentication yet, so the collection-level auth mode is `none` and
  every request inherits it. When auth arrives, set it once here rather than per request.
}
